  "description": "After six years, gaming nerd Lee Jinho finally finishes Reset Life, a brutal mobile game where you have to clear 99 different lives. Just as the thrill of victory fades and emptiness takes hold, a sudden message reveals the game has merged with reality. The true 100th round begins, marking the start of his real reset life. Now, armed with his knowledge from the game, Jinho sets out to reclaim all the skills he once mastered, living as a model, actor, chef, and more in his ultimate new life!\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
